12. Performance and reliability
Use cursor-based pagination for message history.
Add appropriate database indexes after examining actual query patterns.
Avoid loading entire conversation histories into memory.
Avoid one database query per message for employee information.
Subscribe only to the relevant authorized Realtime streams.
Clean up subscriptions when components unmount or conversations change.
Handle reconnects and duplicate events.
Use reliable persistence and retry-safe event processing for important notifications.
Prevent duplicate sends caused by retries where feasible.
Keep unread counts consistent with persisted state.
Avoid expensive global subscriptions for every employee.
13. Testing requirements
